ka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobhXgPKC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリだからこその空気感でお話できて嬉しかったよ♩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これ好きだったよ〜とかいっぱい褒めてくれるのも嬉しいし、一緒に笑い合うのも好きだし、これしたよ〜ここにいるよ〜とか教えてくれるのも、いとはに聞きたいこと聞いてくれる姿もいとはの唐突な質問に一生懸命答えてくれる姿も全部全部愛おしくてだいすきなんだよー！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとう　⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いとはが全てを捧げて幸せにするからね　！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob1XRraK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobVWYVrJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobIqfnns.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobhBCL7u.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobURXT0a.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもよろしくだよー！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日19:00からは櫻坂のさです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スペシャルウィーク回なので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "☆リアルタイム☆で聴いていただきたいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先週に引き続き、ゆうさぎさんとしづねこさんが来てくれたよ(,,- -,, )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして、、\nデモジェル山下様、エンジェル村井様が降臨してくれました☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お聴き逃しなく！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！今夜はVenue101 さんに出演させていただきます ⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます　！\n櫻坂を届けるぞー！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非見てください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここまで読んでいただきありがとうございます՞⸝⸝> ₃ <⸝⸝՞"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は雨が多いですね(  ･᷅-･᷄ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小雨だったら止むんじゃないかと思って傘を持たずに歩き続けてしまいます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからかな、目的地に着く頃にはびっしょびしょになってることがよくあります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この前はグレーの服が雨で水玉柄になりました(  ･᷅-･᷄ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと基本、歩く時は前しか見てねぇ☆なのでよく水たまりに落ちます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "長靴買うべきかな(´･_･`)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "要検討ですね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それではまた　！"}], "source": "official"}